<title>IRAQ: PUK says may turn to Iran for help against Iraq.</title>
<headline>PUK says may turn to Iran for help against Iraq.</headline>
<dateline>SULAYMANIYA, Iraq 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kurdish rebel leader Jalal Talabani said on Thursday his forces were under new attack by Iraqi troops and a rival Kurd faction and said he was prepared to seek Iranian help if necessary to fight back.</p>
<p>&quot;We will call support from any country which is ready to help us -- from Iran, Syria or Turkey. Whichever of them will help us we welcome,&quot; he told Reuters in an interview in his stronghold of Sulaymaniya in northern Iraq.</p>
</text>
